#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/index.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Kalanjiyam's mission is to preserve and make accessible the ancient "
"Knowledge Systems tradition, powered by BharatGen. Our platform focuses "
"on collaborative proofing and digital preservation of heritage texts, "
"ensuring that this ancient wisdom continues to enlighten future "
"generations. Formal announcements about new features and releases are "
"posted to our <a href=\"%(mailing_url)s\">mailing list</a>."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/index.html:25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We are dedicated to the preservation of classical literature, including "
"texts on medicine, alchemy, yoga, and spiritual practices. Powered by "
"BharatGen, our work combines advanced AI and language technologies with "
"dedicated community collaboration. <a href=\"%(code_url)s\">Our code</a> "
"is open source and available on GitHub, reflecting our commitment to "
"transparency and open scholarship."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/index.html:32
#, python-format
msgid ""
