#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:32
msgid "About Kalanjiyam — Powered by BharatGen"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:36
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:39
msgid ""
"Preserving and making accessible ancient knowledge systems through "
"collaborative digital archiving. Powered by BharatGen."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:49
msgid ""
"Kalanjiyam's mission, powered by BharatGen, is to preserve and make "
"accessible ancient knowledge systems through collaborative digital "
"preservation. Specifically, we have three goals:"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:54
msgid "Create a comprehensive digital archive"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:54
msgid "of traditional heritage literature through collaborative proofing."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:57
msgid "Preserve this archive in an open, accessible format"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:57
msgid "for future generations."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:60
msgid "Provide collaborative tools"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:60
msgid ""
"for researchers, practitioners, and community members to contribute to "
"preservation efforts."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:66
msgid "A complete archive"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:69
msgid ""
"The manuscript corpus is vast. Conservative estimates suggest that there "
"are thousands of surviving manuscripts and texts covering medicine, "
"alchemy, yoga, and spiritual knowledge. While many of these manuscripts "
"are near-duplicates of each other, they still represent a literature that"
" is rich and overflowing with ancient wisdom."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:73
msgid ""
"Of these manuscripts, only a few are available as published books. Of "
"these books, only a few are available as digital scans. Of these scans, "
"only a few are available as machine-readable text files. And of these "
"files, only a few are reliable and error-free."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:77
msgid ""
"There are several online archives that have made sincere efforts to "
"preserve and display some of this vast literature. We are deeply grateful"
" to our predecessors and their work. But sadly, creating a complete "
"archive is a massive and multidisciplinary project, and it requires "
"resources that most projects lack."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:81
msgid ""
"We believe that our collective engineering skill can drastically cut the "
"cost of publishing these texts. By doing so, we hope to succeed at this "
"massive task and build an archive that is as complete as possible."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:86
msgid "An open format"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:89
msgid ""
"A complete archive is of no use if it is difficult to access. We must "
"publish this archive as openly as we can and remove the tedious barriers "
"that impede access to classical literature."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:93
msgid ""
"More concretely, we publish our texts on a free and public website under "
"permissive licensing. We ensure that our texts are delightfully readable "
"on a variety of devices. We share our work freely so that users can take "
"what we produce and use it for their own needs, whatever they might be."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:97
msgid ""
"Soon, our website will be available in multiple languages. That way, "
"every reader can access and enjoy our collection in their native "
"language."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:102
msgid "Collaborative preservation tools"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:105
msgid ""
"Our proofing platform, powered by BharatGen, provides the tools needed "
"for community-driven preservation of heritage texts, making the archive "
"more accessible and accurate for all."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/mission.html:109
msgid ""
"For volunteers and contributors, our proofing interface makes it easy to "
"transcribe and verify texts from manuscripts and printed sources. The "
"collaborative nature ensures accuracy and community involvement in "
"preservation efforts."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/our-name.html:14
msgid ""
"When we first started planning this project, we knew we wanted to build a"
" platform to transcribe and preserve heritage texts and manuscripts. "
"Since the platform would store texts in a digital format and make them "
"accessible to everyone, we wanted a name that reflected this purpose."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/our-name.html:21
msgid ""
"After much consideration, we chose to name the project \"Kalanjiyam,\" "
"which means \"treasure of knowledge\" or \"repository of wisdom\" in "
"Tamil. This name perfectly captures our mission to preserve and share the"
" vast knowledge contained in ancient texts, powered by BharatGen."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/our-name.html:28
msgid ""
"As a Tamil word, it is simple and meaningful to the ear. It represents "
"the ancient wisdom and knowledge systems that we are working to preserve "
"and make accessible. The word \"Kalanjiyam\" itself embodies the concept "
"of a comprehensive collection of knowledge, which is exactly what we aim "
"to create."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/our-name.html:35
msgid ""
"The name also reflects our commitment to preserving the cultural and "
"linguistic heritage of traditional knowledge systems, which has its roots"
" in Tamil Nadu and has contributed significantly to the fields of "
"medicine, alchemy, and spiritual knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/about/our-name.html:41
msgid ""
"We believe that this name honors the tradition we serve while also being "
"accessible and memorable to our global community of users and "
"contributors."
msgstr ""

