"The शब्दकल्पद्रुमः generally expects that nominals are given in their "
"प्रथमा-एकवचनम् form instead of their प्रातिपदिक form (नरः and राजा "
"instead of नर and राजन्) and that roots are stated in their Paninian form"
" (चर and षह instead of चर् and सह्)."
