#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:89
msgid "Complete Proofing Guide"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:92
msgid ""
"Detailed spelling, formatting, and transliteration standards for high-"
"fidelity digitization."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:112
msgid ""
"Our goal is to create high-quality, reusable Sanskrit text files. Once "
"proofed, our text files can be formatted as beautiful web pages, "
"converted into PDFs and e-books, analyzed by computational linguists, or "
"used in dictionary searches."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:116
msgid "The Golden Rule:"
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:118
msgid ""
"Proof the text as it is written in the original print edition, even if it"
" contains obvious typos or archaic spellings."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:125
msgid ""
"When a word is split across two lines with a hyphen, remove the hyphen "
"and join the word together unless it is a compound word that requires "
"hyphenation."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:129
msgid ""
"Use standard hyphens (-) for hyphenated compound words and em-dashes (—) "
"for parenthetical pauses."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:134
msgid ""
"Keep line breaks matching the original verse structure for poetry and "
"slokas. For continuous prose, join lines into coherent paragraph blocks."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:137
msgid ""
"Do not transcribe running headers, page numbers, or publisher marks. "
"Transcribe only the core text content of the page."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:140
msgid ""
"Footnotes should be placed at the bottom of the text block enclosed in "
"footnote tags."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:145
msgid ""
"If the original print has a clear printing error, use error tags to "
"preserve both original reading and corrected text."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:148
msgid ""
"For smudged or unreadable text in the scan, mark the characters using the"
" uncertain tag button."
msgstr ""

#: kalanjiyam/templates/proofing/complete-guide.html:151
msgid ""
"If you have questions not covered in this guide, please post in our "
"community discussion forums or send a message via our contact form."
msgstr ""

